  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-13",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我们刚好给布小谷开一个庆祝会  (Throwing Bu Xiaogu a Stage Celebration)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While everyone waits at Studio One for Xin Huimei's delayed rehearsal, the crew turns the stage into a lively promotion party for Bu Xiaogu—just as a visiting talent executive walks in with Huimei's manager. Listen to Xiaogu, Chun Yuqiao, and Xin Huimei in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我求求大家了，我真的不会唱歌，你们干脆杀了我吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么情况啊？你会唱歌？那好好唱，拿个话筒过去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "忙着呢，而且你要是问她的行程，你得问她的经纪人啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是东海经纪的涂盛涂总吗？我是荣思伦哥哥的铁杆大影迷，你能不能跟他说一声我要嫁给他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你有他电话吗？你先把他电话给我，我真的要嫁给他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我代表星天总编室欢迎您啊！惠美全国巡演就要开始了，这段时间特别忙，录完这期节目就得出发。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "涂总，你把你电话留给我也行，我不挑！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那是你男神啊？男神还挺多，还不挑！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不好意思，我迟到了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事，我们不等大腕儿我们等谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这和大腕儿不大腕儿的没什么关系，你知道我工作从来不迟到，今天真的是第一次，实在不好意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "真的没事，再说了，我们刚好给布小谷开一个庆祝会！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我求求大家了，我真的不会唱歌，你们干脆杀了我吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm begging everyone — I truly can't sing a note, so just put me out of my misery!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么情况啊？你会唱歌？那好好唱，拿个话筒过去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What's going on here? Oh, you're singing? Sing properly then — somebody hand her a microphone!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "忙着呢，而且你要是问她的行程，你得问她的经纪人啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She's tied up right now — besides, if you're asking after her schedule, you ought to ask her manager here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是东海经纪的涂盛涂总吗？我是荣思伦哥哥的铁杆大影迷，你能不能跟他说一声我要嫁给他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait — are you Director Tu Sheng of Donghai Talent? I'm Rong Silun's biggest die-hard fan; please tell him I want to marry him!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你有他电话吗？你先把他电话给我，我真的要嫁给他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have his phone number? Give me his number first — I really mean it!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我代表星天总编室欢迎您啊！惠美全国巡演就要开始了，这段时间特别忙，录完这期节目就得出发。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On behalf of Xingtian's chief editor's office, welcome! Huimei's national tour kicks off soon, so she has to set off right after taping.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "涂总，你把你电话留给我也行，我不挑！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Tu, leaving me your own phone number works too — I'm not picky!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那是你男神啊？男神还挺多，还不挑！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So he's your dream idol? Quite a long list of dream idols — and not picky either!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不好意思，我迟到了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm so sorry — I'm late!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没事，我们不等大腕儿我们等谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's fine — if we don't wait for a superstar, who else would we wait for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这和大腕儿不大腕儿的没什么关系，你知道我工作从来不迟到，今天真的是第一次，实在不好意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Superstar or not has nothing to do with it; you know I am never late for work — today is truly my first time, and I'm terribly sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "真的没事，再说了，我们刚好给布小谷开一个庆祝会！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly it's fine — besides, we just used the time to throw Bu Xiaogu a promotion party!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
